    "detailed_description": "<strong>STARUSTER</strong> is a musical and rhythmic experience in which you will face a challenge that will test your skills and reflexes. We invite you to dive into our neon and sound-filled world in which your main objective is to collect all the arrows to the rhythm of the music, but avoiding catching the spikeballs. Any mistake in this dynamic will make you lose the game instantly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878260/extras/371b474b5c7287d06056bb82391cb86d.poster.avif?t=1753611667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878260/extras/371b474b5c7287d06056bb82391cb86d.webm?t=1753611667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878260/extras/371b474b5c7287d06056bb82391cb86d.mp4?t=1753611667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Show your skills and manage to beat all the levels!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outstanding Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Musical and rhythmic gameplay: Immerse yourself in the melody as you challenge your skills.<br></li><li> Constant challenge: Increasingly complex patterns will test your reflexes and accuracy.<br></li><li> Collect the arrows: Use the mouse to catch all the arrows at the right time.<br></li><li> Avoid the spikeballs: Watch out for the pointy balls, any mistake will be fatal.<br></li><li> High scores: Compete against your friends to get the highest score.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Download the Demo Now and Show Your Skills!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>STARUSTER</strong> is a musical and rhythmic experience in which you will face a challenge that will test your skills and reflexes. We invite you to dive into our neon and sound-filled world in which your main objective is to collect all the arrows to the rhythm of the music, but avoiding catching the spikeballs. Any mistake in this dynamic will make you lose the game instantly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878260/extras/371b474b5c7287d06056bb82391cb86d.poster.avif?t=1753611667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878260/extras/371b474b5c7287d06056bb82391cb86d.webm?t=1753611667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878260/extras/371b474b5c7287d06056bb82391cb86d.mp4?t=1753611667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Show your skills and manage to beat all the levels!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outstanding Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Musical and rhythmic gameplay: Immerse yourself in the melody as you challenge your skills.<br></li><li> Constant challenge: Increasingly complex patterns will test your reflexes and accuracy.<br></li><li> Collect the arrows: Use the mouse to catch all the arrows at the right time.<br></li><li> Avoid the spikeballs: Watch out for the pointy balls, any mistake will be fatal.<br></li><li> High scores: Compete against your friends to get the highest score.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Download the Demo Now and Show Your Skills!</h2>",
